WEBVTT

00:00:09,010 --> 00:00:14,610
If I send you my labs, do you look at them and decide if we need to talk about them?

00:00:15,890 --> 00:00:21,810
I want you to send me your labs, send us your labs so that we can get them in your folder.

00:00:21,810 --> 00:00:28,530
But no, I'm not going to, I just don't have time to look at everybody's labs and then decide

00:00:28,530 --> 00:00:35,410
if we need to talk to them. That takes anywhere from 10 to 30 minutes to really look at everybody's

00:00:35,410 --> 00:00:40,530
lab. Sometimes it could take longer than if I could period to pass labs. You're going to have

00:00:40,530 --> 00:00:46,450
to make that decision because if I did it order those labs specifically, then you know, you're

00:00:46,450 --> 00:00:50,850
getting those labs down and you're going to have to make that decision whether you want to speak

00:00:50,850 --> 00:00:55,490
with me. So, on the rare occasion that I have time and I do look at some of these labs, there's

00:00:55,490 --> 00:00:59,970
probably somebody listed in this and well, you called and said you wanted to talk to me after that.

00:00:59,970 --> 00:01:04,770
After you looked at my lab, there's times that I do have time and I look at them.

00:01:04,770 --> 00:01:09,170
But usually, I don't. So, it just gets put in your file.

00:01:11,410 --> 00:01:16,850
So, it is ultimately your responsibility to, hey, I need to talk to them about my labs.

00:01:18,690 --> 00:01:24,610
So, otherwise, it's just, I don't have enough time in the day to do that. Sorry.

